flowchart TD
    SRC["Source open data<br/>donnees.roulez-eco.fr<br/>XML-ZIP, MAJ ~10 min"]
    ING["Cloud Run Job (Python)<br/>déclenché par Cloud Scheduler<br/>micro-batch HORAIRE"]
    GCS["GCS bronze<br/>XML brut + Parquet typé<br/>partitionné par date d'ingestion"]
    SF["Snowflake (région GCP)<br/>warehouse PRINCIPAL<br/>XS + auto-suspend"]
    BQ["BigQuery silver/gold<br/>démo LIVE durable<br/>free tier"]
    DBT["dbt Core<br/>staging -> intermediate -> gold<br/>targets: snowflake | bigquery"]
    TEST["dbt tests + model contracts<br/>+ freshness checks"]
    PBI["Power BI<br/>case study (← Snowflake)"]
    LS["Looker Studio<br/>carte/KPIs live (← BigQuery)"]
    CI["GitHub Actions<br/>dbt build BLOQUANT (target bigquery)"]

    SRC --> ING --> GCS
    GCS --> SF
    GCS --> BQ
    SF --> DBT
    BQ --> DBT
    DBT --> TEST
    SF --> PBI
    BQ --> LS
    CI -. bloque le merge si un test échoue .-> DBT
